extends layout

block scripts
  script(src="/scripts/slideshow.js")

block content
  h1 Welcome to Lekker Leftovers



  p.lead
    | A digital platform designed to connect local food suppliers with customers while promoting sustainability and reducing food waste in Makers Valley, Johannesburg.

  h2 What is Lekker Leftovers?
  p
    | Lekker Leftovers helps suppliers list excess or unsold food that can still be consumed safely. 
    | Customers can browse and reserve available items — helping the environment and their budget.
  
  #slideshow-wrapper
    #slideshow-container
      .slide
        img.slideshow-image(src="images/index_image1.jpg" alt="Delicious food 1")
      .slide
        img.slideshow-image(src="images/index_image2.jpg" alt="Delicious food 2")
      .slide
        img.slideshow-image(src="images/index_image3.jpg" alt="Delicious food 3")
    .dots
    span.dot(data-index="0")
    span.dot(data-index="1")
    span.dot(data-index="2")

  h2 About the Project
  p
    | This project is part of the 
    strong Engineers Without Borders Digital Design Challenge
    | , aimed at solving real problems within the Makers Valley community through sustainable and inclusive software design.


